<title>CANADA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER SECOND ROUND OF LPGA DU MAURIER.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER SECOND ROUND OF LPGA DU MAURIER.</headline>
<dateline>OAKVILLE, Ontario 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>the second round at the LPGA du Maurier Classic golf</p>
<p>tournament on Friday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>136 Kelly Robbins 71 65</p>
<p>138 Liselotte Neumann (Sweden) 71 67</p>
<p>139 Juli Inkster 70 69</p>
<p>140 Rosie Jones 69 71, Colleen Walker 68 72, Betsy King 71,</p>
<p>69, Donna Andrews 71 69</p>
<p>141 Penny Hammell 69 70, Tracy Hanson 72 69</p>
